From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: lethalbas <lethalbas@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 27 Nov 2026 19:50:20 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] Shaders: make getTexture a macro (build with Vulkan SDK
 1.4.363 glslc)

glslang shipped with Vulkan SDK 1.4.363.0 (shaderc v2026.4) rejects
functions returning a sampler when generating SPIR-V:
  ShaderCommonGLSLFunc.h:70: error: 'return' : sampler or image cannot
  be used as return type when generating SPIR-V
This broke 8 shaders (incl. RtRaygen*, RtAlphaTest, RsRasterizer*).
Backport of upstream RTGL1 commit a2ad71e (Friedrich Vock, 2023-11-26,
'Make getTexture a macro'). getTexture() has no callers at v1.1.0.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 Source/Shaders/ShaderCommonGLSLFunc.h | 5 +----
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 4 deletions(-)

diff --git a/Source/Shaders/ShaderCommonGLSLFunc.h b/Source/Shaders/ShaderCommonGLSLFunc.h
index 5b6a82e13176fda73b1a06d808153a549335a967..d940526343a92a3dfb0452070db7f1d361518e37 100644
--- a/Source/Shaders/ShaderCommonGLSLFunc.h
+++ b/Source/Shaders/ShaderCommonGLSLFunc.h
@@ -65,10 +65,7 @@ layout(
     binding = BINDING_TEXTURES)
     uniform sampler2D globalTextures[];
 
-sampler2D getTexture(uint textureIndex)
-{
-    return globalTextures[nonuniformEXT(textureIndex)];
-}
+#define getTexture(textureIndex) globalTextures[nonuniformEXT(textureIndex)]
 
 vec4 getTextureSample(uint textureIndex, const vec2 texCoord)
 {

